 "text": "Agrex\n0\nSkip to Content\nCOMPANY\nPARTNERS\nCAREERS\nCONTACT\nHISTORY\nLOCATIONS\nAll Locations\nBowling Green, OH\nColumbus Grove, OH\nFranklin, TN\nMinneapolis, MN\nMobile, AL\nMontgomery, AL\nMoses Lake, WA\nOverland Park, KS\nPeru, IN | Oracle Pork Nutrition\nSuperior, NE\nTRADING\nCASH BIDS\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nCOMPANY\nPARTNERS\nCAREERS\nCONTACT\nHISTORY\nLOCATIONS\nAll Locations\nBowling Green, OH\nColumbus Grove, OH\nFranklin, TN\nMinneapolis, MN\nMobile, AL\nMontgomery, AL\nMoses Lake, WA\nOverland Park, KS\nPeru, IN | Oracle Pork Nutrition\nSuperior, NE\nTRADING\nCASH BIDS\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nFolder:\nCOMPANY\nHISTORY\nFolder:\nLOCATIONS\nTRADING\nCASH BIDS\nBack\nPARTNERS\nCAREERS\nCONTACT\nBack\nAll Locations\nBowling Green, OH\nColumbus Grove, OH\nFranklin, TN\nMinneapolis, MN\nMobile, AL\nMontgomery, AL\nMoses Lake, WA\nOverland Park, KS\nPeru, IN | Oracle Pork Nutrition\nSuperior, NE\nWE ARE AGREX\nYOUR TRUSTED PARTNER, FROM FIELD TO GLOBAL MARKET\n9 LOCATIONS\nAgrex has nine locations across the US, connecting growers, partners, and global markets through an integrated ag program built on the kind of reliability that creates long-term relationships.\nLOCATIONS\nLOCATIONS\n7 COUNTRIES\nWith global trading reach across seven countries , we are a full-service agricultural commodity trading company handling everything from origination and marketing to financing and logistics.\nTRADING\nTRADING\nCONNECTED WITH PURPOSE\nOur strategically located network connects directly to global trading insight, linking local supply to international demand. It’s how we connect markets with purpose , creating value at every step of the journey.\nOVER 50 YEARS OF PARTNERSHIP-DRIVEN GROWTH\nIn the past five decades, we have grown into a well-known player in the U.S. and international grain markets, expanding to nine locations and nearly 110 employees, as well as several joint ventures that add to our network of origination areas. Our role in the grain, feed and food ingredient value chains allows us to work closely with producers to market their grain to end-users and manufacturers worldwide.\nOUR HISTORY\nTRUSTED IN EVERY MARKET WE SERVE\nOUR PARTNERS\nGET MORE DONE IN A DAY WITH AGREX\nCASH BIDS\nTEXT ALERTS\niPHONE APP\nANDROID APP\n9401 Indian Creek Parkway, Suite 1450\nOverland Park, KS 66210\n(913) 851-6300\nExplore\nHome\nPartners\nCareers\nContact\nHistory\nLocations ‍\nTrading\nElevators\nColumbus Grove, OH\nMobile, AL\nMontgomery, AL\nPeru, IN (Oracle Pork Nutrition)\nSuperior, NE\nTrading Offices\nBowling Green, OH\nFranklin, TN\nMinneapolis, MN\nMoses Lake, WA\nOverland Park, KS\nSuperior, NE\nHeadquarters\nOverland Park, KS\nForage Export\nMoses Lake, WA\nCopyright 2026 Agrex Inc. All rights reserved. Agrex Inc. is a subsidiary of Mitsubishi Corporation. Policies | California Privacy Policy | Safety Data Sheet",
